# EtherRPCEm module version, in the RISC OS VersionNum style.
#
# The Makefile turns this into version.inc, which supplies the module's help
# string. Bump both fields together when the module changes.
#
# 1.05 was the version of the C module inherited from Castle's EtherY by way of
# Alex Waugh's RPCEmu adaptation, and 1.06 is the first assembler build: the
# port changed how the module is built rather than what it does, but it is a
# different binary with different dependencies (no shared C library), so the
# number had to move rather than claim to be the same module.
#
# The date is deliberate rather than a true build stamp, as with the other
# modules here: the assembled module is committed as netroms/EtherRPCEm,ffa and
# only rebuilt when someone runs build.sh --podules, so a real build date would
# record when that last happened. Override with `make MODULE_DATE="..."`.

Module_MajorVersion	1.06
Module_Date		11 Aug 2026
